      "side": 1,
      "message": "note that there\u0027s technically a little race condition here, if 2 threads call start() concurrently then the second one will set mFinished to true.\n\nProb not a big deal in practice since it\u0027s unlikely that any code would call start from multiple threads, but just pointing it out.\n\nFeel free to ignore it.",
      "revId": "293cd774c4960df66e8ea3743f9e6e7101130981",
