        "id": 1891430
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-07T20:01:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of only signaling if the queue was previously empty, I would suggest making this simpler and always signaling. The condition variable will handle the rest for you, if the thread was already processing tasks it will be a no-op.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 129,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 131,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "293cd774c4960df66e8ea3743f9e6e7101130981",
