        "id": 1891430
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-07T20:01:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that this doesn\u0027t deal with spurrious wakes (ie: the condition variable may be notified even though the queue is still empty.",
      "revId": "293cd774c4960df66e8ea3743f9e6e7101130981",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
